<div class="blurb">
<div class="header"><h2>health concerns</h2></div>
<div class="body">
<ul>
<li><strong>Excitotoxicity</strong> (glutamate storms) - overstimulation of neurons <sup><a href="#src-excitotoxicity">excitotoxicity</a>, <a href="#src-excitotoxicity-2">excitotoxicity-2</a>, <a href="#src-excitotoxicity-3">excitotoxicity-3</a>, <a href="#src-excitotoxicity-4">excitotoxicity-4</a>, <a href="#src-excitotoxicity-5">excitotoxicity-5</a>, <a href="#src-excitotoxicity-3-rep1">excitotoxicity-3-rep1</a>, <a href="#src-excitotoxicity-3-rep2">excitotoxicity-3-rep2</a>, <a href="#src-excitotoxicity-3-rep3">excitotoxicity-3-rep3</a>, <a href="#src-excitotoxicity-5-rep1">excitotoxicity-5-rep1</a>, <a href="#src-excitotoxicity-5-rep2">excitotoxicity-5-rep2</a></sup></li>
<li><strong>Headaches / Migraines</strong> - documented trigger in multiple studies <sup><a href="#src-headache">headache</a>, <a href="#src-headache-2">headache-2</a>, <a href="#src-headache-3">headache-3</a>, <a href="#src-headache-4">headache-4</a>, <a href="#src-headache-3-rep1">headache-3-rep1</a>, <a href="#src-headache-3-rep2">headache-3-rep2</a>, <a href="#src-headache-3-rep3">headache-3-rep3</a></sup></li>
<li><strong>Digestive issues</strong> - constipation, gut microbiota changes, visceral pain <sup><a href="#src-gut">gut</a>, <a href="#src-gut-2">gut-2</a>, <a href="#src-gut-3">gut-3</a>, <a href="#src-gut-4">gut-4</a>, <a href="#src-gut-3-rep1">gut-3-rep1</a>, <a href="#src-gut-3-rep2">gut-3-rep2</a>, <a href="#src-gut-3-rep3">gut-3-rep3</a></sup></li>
<li><strong>Respiratory issues</strong> - asthma, sinus problems <sup><a href="#src-respiratory">respiratory</a>, <a href="#src-respiratory-2">respiratory-2</a>, <a href="#src-respiratory-3">respiratory-3</a>, <a href="#src-respiratory-4">respiratory-4</a>, <a href="#src-respiratory-rep1">respiratory-rep1</a>, <a href="#src-respiratory-rep2">respiratory-rep2</a>, <a href="#src-respiratory-rep3">respiratory-rep3</a>, <a href="#src-respiratory-4-rep1">respiratory-4-rep1</a>, <a href="#src-respiratory-4-rep2">respiratory-4-rep2</a></sup></li>
<li><strong>Skin reactions / Acne flare-ups</strong> - MSG may worsen existing skin conditions via gut-immune-skin axis <sup><a href="#src-skin">skin</a>, <a href="#src-skin-2">skin-2</a>, <a href="#src-skin-3">skin-3</a>, <a href="#src-skin-4">skin-4</a></sup></li>
<li><strong>True MSG allergy</strong> - Rare but documented Type I food allergy to MSG confirmed via oral challenge <sup><a href="#src-allergy">allergy</a>, <a href="#src-allergy-2">allergy-2</a>, <a href="#src-allergy-3">allergy-3</a>, <a href="#src-allergy-4">allergy-4</a></sup></li>
<li><strong>Skin/mucosal irritation</strong> - MSG on cracked skin or chapped lips may cause stinging (like salt on a wound) <sup><a href="#src-skin">skin</a>, <a href="#src-skin-2">skin-2</a>, <a href="#src-skin-5">skin-5</a>, <a href="#src-skin-6">skin-6</a>, <a href="#src-respiratory-rep3">respiratory-rep3</a></sup></li>
<li>Linked to: diabetes, multiple sclerosis, rheumatoid arthritis <sup><a href="#src-linked">linked</a>, <a href="#src-linked-2">linked-2</a>, <a href="#src-linked-3">linked-3</a>, <a href="#src-linked-4">linked-4</a>, <a href="#src-linked-rep1">linked-rep1</a>, <a href="#src-linked-rep2">linked-rep2</a>, <a href="#src-linked-rep3">linked-rep3</a>, <a href="#src-linked-4-rep1">linked-4-rep1</a>, <a href="#src-linked-4-rep2">linked-4-rep2</a>, <a href="#src-linked-4-rep3">linked-4-rep3</a></sup></li>
<li><span class="highlight">May suppress immune system</span> <sup><a href="#src-immune">immune</a>, <a href="#src-immune-2">immune-2</a>, <a href="#src-immune-3">immune-3</a>, <a href="#src-immune-4">immune-4</a></sup></li>
<li>Effects are <strong>cumulative</strong> with repeated exposure <sup><a href="#src-cumulative">cumulative</a>, <a href="#src-cumulative-2">cumulative-2</a>, <a href="#src-cumulative-3">cumulative-3</a>, <a href="#src-cumulative-4">cumulative-4</a>, <a href="#src-cumulative-2-rep1">cumulative-2-rep1</a>, <a href="#src-cumulative-2-rep2">cumulative-2-rep2</a>, <a href="#src-cumulative-4-rep1">cumulative-4-rep1</a>, <a href="#src-cumulative-4-rep2">cumulative-4-rep2</a>, <a href="#src-cumulative-4-rep3">cumulative-4-rep3</a></sup></li>
</ul>
</div>
